# z3660eth: its .moddata keys (amix-dlm C3-1 section 3, C3-6 v2 section 2)
# and the definition line, as the ABI kit's mkmod reads a Master.
# module/Makefile writes build/<line>/Master from this file, @CPU@ filled
# in: 68030 on k30, 68040 on k46.  kabi and cc come from the kit.
# No $match: the board can be present without an AutoConfig entry (the
# AGA fixed-base fallback in z3660eth_map).
$modtype drv
$class boot
$cpu @CPU@
$majors c:51
$unload never
$param intr:int:0:0:6
$param intrl2:int:1:0:1
$desc Z3660 ethernet zen0 (STREAMS/DLPI)
z3660eth	z3660eth
